# Protocol v0 additions: box, circle, text, palette, screens, blits, images.
# Run: build/hp41-gfx --script tests/gfx/v1.gfx --assets tests/assets
GI

# box outline from the pen to the opposite corner; the pen moves there
M 10 10:B 20 15
!pixel 0 10 10 1
!pixel 0 20 15 1
!pixel 0 15 10 1
!pixel 0 15 15 1
!pixel 0 10 12 1
!pixel 0 15 12 0
# filled box
K 3:M 30 30:BF 33 32
!pixel 0 31 31 3
!pixel 0 33 32 3
!pixel 0 34 32 0
BF 1
!err 2

# circle outline and filled circle, centred on the pen
K 4:M 100 100:O 5
!pixel 0 105 100 4
!pixel 0 100 95 4
!pixel 0 100 100 0
K 5:OF 3
!pixel 0 100 100 5
!pixel 0 103 100 5
!pixel 0 104 100 0
O -1
!err 4

# text: 5x7 glyphs, 6 pixel pitch, top left at the pen, pen colour
K 6:M 200 50:L A
!pixel 0 200 51 6
!pixel 0 200 50 0
!pixel 0 201 50 6
!pixel 0 201 54 6
!pixel 0 201 52 0
# L takes the rest of the line, separators included
M 200 70:L A:B
!err 0
!pixel 0 207 71 6
!pixel 0 212 70 6
# the pen moves past the text (and ':P 0 0' here is text, not a command)
M 200 90:L AB:P 0 0
!pixel 0 0 0 0
M 200 110:L AB
D 212 120
!pixel 0 212 115 6
# text scale
LS 2:M 300 100:L A
!pixel 0 300 102 6
!pixel 0 301 103 6
LS 9
!err 4
LS 1

# palette of the target screen
KP 200 10 20 30
?P 200
!reply 10 20 30
?P 256
!err 4
KP 1 2 3
!err 2

# screens: copy, swap, show next
GI
T 2:C 7:KP 7 1 2 3
T 3:CS 2
!pixel 3 0 0 7
?P 7
!reply 1 2 3
T 0:SW 2 0
!pixel 0 5 5 7
!pixel 2 5 5 0
?P 7
!reply 1 2 3
S 15:SN
!shown 0
SN
!shown 1
CS 16
!err 4

# blit, copying indices
GI
T 1:W 0 0 9:W 1 0 0:W 2 0 9
T 0:BL 1 0 0 3 1 50 50
!pixel 0 50 50 9
!pixel 0 51 50 0
!pixel 0 52 50 9
# with a transparent index
C 5:BT 0:BL 1 0 0 3 1 60 50:BT
!pixel 0 60 50 9
!pixel 0 61 50 5
!pixel 0 62 50 9
# colour-converting blit: screen 1 entry 9 is pure red, so BC gives screen 0's
# nearest entry (2, red); BL copies the index unchanged
T 1:KP 9 255 0 0:T 0:BC 1 0 0 1 1 70 50
!pixel 0 70 50 2
BL 1 0 0 1 1 71 50
!pixel 0 71 50 9
# overlapping blit within one screen moves the row right by one
T 1:BL 1 0 0 3 1 1 0
!pixel 1 1 0 9
!pixel 1 2 0 0
!pixel 1 3 0 9
T 0
BL 1 0 0 3 1 50
!err 2
BL 16 0 0 1 1 0 0
!err 4
BL 1 0 0 1.5 1 0 0
!err 3

# image assets: SPRITE.png is 8x8 white, blue at 0 0, transparent 4x4 centre
IL SPRITE 0
!err 0
?I 0
!reply 8 8
IP 0 100 200
!pixel 0 100 200 4
!pixel 0 101 200 1
!pixel 0 103 203 5
!pixel 0 107 207 1
!pixel 0 108 208 5
# the same asset sprayed on another screen
T 4:IP 0 0 0:T 0
!pixel 4 0 0 4
!pixel 4 3 3 0
R 103 203
!reply 5
IL NOSUCH 1
!err 8
IP 1 0 0
!err 10
IL BAD/NAME 2
!err 8
IF 0
IP 0 0 0
!err 10
?E
!reply E 10 NO ASSET
